# Local QA screenshots
scripts/_walkthrough/

# Material-system merge shots (scripts/live-material-probe.mjs, SHOT_DIR=.qa-design).
# Evidence, not source: the probe is committed so anyone can RE-SHOOT, and the images
# are not, because a checked-in PNG is a claim nobody can re-derive. Same rule as
# .qa-s3*/ — see docs/design-brief/INTAKE.md §3b "what to delete outside src/".
.qa-design/
# ⭐ And the BEFORE/AFTER pairs an M1 atom shoots either side of its deploy
# (SHOT_DIR=.qa-design-before / -after, compared by scripts/material-ring-delta.mjs).
.qa-design-*/
# Poll-board evidence shots (scripts/live-poll-board.mjs --shots). Same rule: the
# probe is committed so the board can be RE-SHOT at any width and locale; the PNGs
# are not, because a checked-in screenshot is a claim nobody can re-derive.
.qa-board/
# Resolution-criterion i18n shots (npm run qa:criterion-visual --shots). Same rule.
# ⭐ Re-shooting the TRANSLATED arm needs `npm run db:seed-criterion-local` first —
# until F6b/F6c land, no production poll has a translated criterion to photograph.
.qa-f6*/

# Test images (user reference, not for production)
Test Images/
F1 Tetsing image/

